##### Project Impact

The analyses and evidence generated through ASPR 2024 supported the Government of Bangladesh and development partners in monitoring sector performance, evaluating progress against PEDP4 and SDG4 targets, identifying policy priorities, and informing strategic planning and resource allocation for the primary education sector. The report serves as a key reference for annual education sector reviews, development planning, and international reporting.
